# Doctrine snapshot — {{CAMPAIGN_TITLE}}

**Referenced, never auto-loaded.** `CLAUDE.md` carries the integrity core, the research reflexes and
the hard gates: what must be in context every turn. This file carries the reasoning behind them. Open
it when you need the why behind a rule, when a decision falls outside the ones stated there, or when
deciding whether something counts as a rule at all.

**A record, not a dependency.** It is the physkit doctrine as it stood when this campaign was
scaffolded, frozen and provenance-stamped. A later kit version does not retroactively govern a run
that already happened, so this file is never re-synced against a newer `CORE.md` (lint-ok: the kit's
file, not this tree). Not re-syncing keeps this campaign's governing doctrine recoverable. If the
live doctrine has moved on and that matters, record a finding in the journal; do not edit this file.

